@startuml
!include ../_theme.puml
title Packagepack Resolution
top to bottom direction

package "Declared Choices" {
  rectangle "Packagepack Intake" as Packagepack
  rectangle "Enginepack Selection" as Enginepack <<zoom>> [[resolve_packagepack/select_enginepack.puml]]
  rectangle "Gamepack Selection" as Gamepack
  rectangle "Modpack Resolution" as Modpacks
}

rectangle "Dependency Check" as Deps <<zoom>> [[resolve_packagepack/check_dependencies.puml]]
rectangle "Launch Plan Emission" as Plan

Packagepack --> Enginepack : uses engine ref to
Packagepack --> Gamepack : uses game ref to
Packagepack --> Modpacks : uses mod refs to
Enginepack --> Deps : contributes engine constraints to
Gamepack --> Deps : contributes game constraints to
Modpacks --> Deps : contributes mod constraints to
Deps --> Plan : produces compatible set for
@enduml
